      "id": "node-hw-specs",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 15x15 Matrix Key Invariants\n\n* **RF Frequency**: 13.56 MHz (ISO 15693 / 14443A)\n* **Target Inductance**: ~1.2 µH – 1.8 µH per coil\n* **Multiplexers**: 74HC4067 / RF switches\n* **Wood Permittivity**: $\\epsilon_r = 2.5 - 3.5$\n* **Max Veneer Thickness**: $\\le 2.5\\text{mm}$\n* **Full Scan Cycle**: $\\le 500\\text{ms}$\n* **Power**: 3.7V 3000mAh Li-ion + Mag-Dock\n* **Turntable**: 250mm ball-bearing ring",
